+- `lake build`: exit 0;
+- status: `KLEAN_NO_OBLIGATIONS`;
+- obligation count: 0;
+- target: `null`;
+- immutable Stage 1, Stage 3, and generated-tree hashes unchanged; and
+- generated trust declarations: 47, with zero generated sorries and no
